  "releaseNotes": "TRIAL EDITION - SQL longer than 10,000 characters is rejected (parse() returns -1). Full edition: https://www.sqlparser.com\n\nRelease 4.1.0.7\n\n- [build] The NuGet package now ships a README, which nuget.org renders\n  as the package page. It covers installation, a worked parsing example\n  with its real output, the EDbVendor constant for each of the 15\n  supported databases, and the target frameworks. The 4.1.0.6 package\n  had no readme, so its page showed only the one-line description.\n  No library code changed between 4.1.0.6 and 4.1.0.7.\n\nDemos: https://github.com/sqlparser/gsp_dotnet/tree/master/gsp_demo_dotnet/src/demos",
